text VictoryRoad_Bear_BattleIntro{
    "BEAR: I visited Big Dog Island when \n"
    "I found out TLDP went there! \p"
    "I caught my POKéMON there, wanna see \n"
    "them? $"
}

text VictoryRoad_Bear_PostBattle{
    "BEAR: Have you been to Big Dog Island? \p"
    "I really liked it there, and I love \n"
    "the song Big Dog too! $"
}

