text VictoryRoad_Q_BattleIntro{
    "Q: I've been listening to The Last \n"
    "Dinner Party's music on a loop for \l"
    "months! \p"
    "I can't wait to face them, can I battle \p"
    "with you to be sure I'm ready? $"
